{"3579350": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "AstroScaper", "steam_appid": 3579350, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5057310], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every asteroid is procedurally generated, every building placement matters, and every colony becomes a new puzzle to solve.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579350/extras/e2dbc94d7a2fd05883b0a666e75f8349.webp?t=1788061533\" width=780 height=27 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579350/extras/f3ebf6e4ed011cc550cc81b8a0cf815b.avif?t=1788061533\" width=780 height=92 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579350/extras/84fc8975051fd30c923c797268c3a6e7.avif?t=1788061533\" width=780 height=443 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579350/extras/e2dbc94d7a2fd05883b0a666e75f8349.webp?t=1788061533\" width=780 height=27 /></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buildings gain different costs and rewards depending on what surrounds them. Maximize their effectiveness while keeping your resources steady for future moves. Reach score milestones to earn new building choices and keep expanding your colony. Plan efficient layouts shaped by each procedurally generated asteroid and its unique resource distribution.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579350/extras/e2dbc94d7a2fd05883b0a666e75f8349.webp?t=1788061533\" width=780 height=27 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\