your expedition, unlock new buildings and explore different asteroid types. Push your scores higher and see how you compare with other players on the leaderboard.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579350/extras/e2dbc94d7a2fd05883b0a666e75f8349.webp?t=1788061533\" width=780 height=27 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579350/extras/5b1d728145e20f62e372c6e3309eab71.poster.avif?t=1788061533\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579350/extras/5b1d728145e20f62e372c6e3309eab71.webm?t=1788061533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579350/extras/5b1d728145e20f62e372c6e3309eab71.mp4?t=1788061533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579350/extras/e2dbc94d7a2fd05883b0a666e75f8349.webp?t=1788061533\" width=780 height=27 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579350/extras/58c3ff49d029dc25dcc8f1d55316bd84.avif?t=1788061533\" width=780 height=92 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579350/extras/ba20aa5a027a51376d16a5b7ddcce8cd.avif?t=1788061533\" width=780 height=443 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579350/extras/e2dbc94d7a2fd05883b0a666e75f8349.webp?t=1788061533\" width=780 height=27 /></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every asteroid in AstroScaper is a tiny, unique world with its own layout and challenges. Enjoy soothing, stylized cosmic scenery as you build across randomly generated environments waiting to be transformed into thriving colonies.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579350/extras/e2dbc94d7a2fd05883b0a666e75f8349.webp?t=1788061533\" width=780 height=27 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579350/extras/5a1e08b42e5a678758bc3ac6aa52ef8a.poster.avif?t=1788061533\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579350/extras/5a1e08b42e5a678758bc3ac6aa52ef8a.webm?t=1788061533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579350/extras/5a1e08b42e5a678758bc3ac6aa52ef8a.mp4?t=1788061533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579350/extras/e2dbc94d7a2fd05883b0a666e75f8349.webp?t=1788061533\" width=780 height=27 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FREEBUILD MODE</h2><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zero pressure, just pure creativity. Build freely without score limits, choose your favorite biome, and shape cozy asteroid colonies at your own pace. Switch to Photo Mode anytime to capture your space settlements from perfect angles.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>AstroScaper is crafted by a two-person team. Inspired by minimalist city-builders like Islanders, it offers a similar pace and aesthetic while introducing new mechanics enabled by its sci-fi setting.<br>We’re pouring our hearts into this little universe and welcome you along for the journey. Feel free to share feedback and ideas!</i></p>", "short_description": "Colonize barren asteroids and transform them into thriving space colonies. Discover powerful building synergies, solve satisfying placement puzzles, and journey from one procedurally generated world to the next.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Indonesian, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Traditional Chinese, Turkish, Russian, Ukrainian, Vietnamese", "reviews": "“Cute city builder with excellent aesthetics that convey a sense of serenity to the player”<br />\r\nDevGAMM Awards Judge 6<br />\r\n<br />\r\n“This game had me hooked! The ambient soundtrack, the space atmosphere, very well done to the creators for making something so peaceful and flow-state inducing!”<br />\r\nDevGAMM Awards Judge 14<br />\r\n", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579350/ff9b24730f8c349df75a88eda6f2b61ad5393254/header.jpg?t=1788061533", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579350/21d15564f7bc36db5681a89dc4b2d1197ae55688/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788061533", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579350/21d15564f7bc36db5681a89dc4b2d1197ae55688/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788061533", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core 2.5 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 560 Ti<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB availa